// Technology definitions — test fixture and reference.
//
// The production game loads its tech tree from `scripts/config/tech_tree.lua`
// (see `lua_bridge::load_tech_tree`). This RON file exists as test-data
// for the domain crate's unit tests and must stay in sync with the Lua file.
// Keep both in sync until the test path is migrated to use the Lua loader.
//
// Reference: original Imperialism manual p.89 (Benefits of Technology Table)
// and p.27–28 (per-civilian gates).
//
// Improvement classes:
//   "Farm"        — Grain on Grassland
//   "Orchard"     — Fruit on Grassland
//   "Plantation"  — Cotton on Grassland
//   "Wool"        — Wool on Hills
//   "Livestock"   — Livestock and Horses on Grassland
//   "Forest"      — Timber in hardwood forest
//   "Mining"      — Coal/Iron/Gold/Gems on Hills/Mountain
//   "Oil"         — Oil on Desert/Swamp/Tundra

